  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A one year bridging agreement with Swedish Society for Nature Conservation amounting to 28 000 000 during 2008, in order for Sida to undertake an in-depth assessment of SSNC&apos;s three year proposal. During 2008, an external framework assessment and a follow-up of the system revision was also undertaken. This 3000000 was for Eastern Europe and the rest of the programme is found under 740032800</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett &#xE5;rig f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;gning av Naturskyddsfr&#xF6;reningens ramavtal, totalt 28 MSEK, var av dessa 3 MSEK g&#xE4;ller f&#xF6;r insatser i &#xD6;st Europe. Resten finns under 740032800</narrative>
